---
Index: libavcodec/libopusenc.c
IDEA additional info:
Subsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP
<+>UTF-8
===================================================================
diff --git a/libavcodec/libopusenc.c b/libavcodec/libopusenc.c
